1uek|n|The act of redressing; a making right; reformation; correction; amendment. ; A setting right, as of wrong, injury, or opression; as, the redress of grievances; hence, relief; remedy; reparation; indemnification. ; One who, or that which, gives relief; a redresser.	a:1zci,68,1~1zci,68,1	v:1zci,105,13~1zci,105,13	n:1zci,84,3~1zci,84,3
